00:00:20.030 --> 00:00:23.030
- So this is the M2 Max MacBook Pro.

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:25.720
Let's talk about it.

00:00:28.830 --> 00:00:30.297
So this week, Apple updated the 14 inch

00:00:30.297 --> 00:00:33.450
and 16 inch MacBook Pros
with a press release

00:00:33.450 --> 00:00:35.250
